00:49:17.995 --> 00:49:18.828
Rule number two.

00:49:18.828 --> 00:49:19.774
Don't talk about Fight Club.

00:49:19.774 --> 00:49:22.096
Rule number three.

00:49:22.096 --> 00:49:24.702
Something about if you're new here,

00:49:24.702 --> 00:49:26.525
you have to fight.

00:49:26.525 --> 00:49:27.358
If you're first...

00:49:27.358 --> 00:49:29.334
I think rule number four
is if your first time

00:49:29.334 --> 00:49:30.167
you have to fight.

00:49:30.167 --> 00:49:31.261
I think rule number three is,

00:49:31.261 --> 00:49:33.980
the fighting goes until one person stops

00:49:33.980 --> 00:49:36.201
or something like that.

00:49:36.201 --> 00:49:37.034
I think there's only four.

00:49:37.034 --> 00:49:38.865
I don't have any rules are.

00:49:38.865 --> 00:49:40.023
That wasn't where I was gonna go,

00:49:40.023 --> 00:49:41.825
but the thing that I realized,

00:49:41.825 --> 00:49:44.085
and this is true, David
Fincher movies in general,

00:49:44.085 --> 00:49:46.131
I actually kind of regretted
not putting Fight Club

00:49:46.131 --> 00:49:48.949
