00:49:48.949 --> 00:49:51.325
I don't know if it would
have made the top 10 but

00:49:51.325 --> 00:49:55.825
you just forget how many
good lines are in his movies.

00:49:57.065 --> 00:49:58.075
I mean, just disclaimer,

00:49:58.075 --> 00:50:00.778
