00:50:05.404 --> 00:50:06.237
But--

00:50:06.237 --> 00:50:07.070
It's not for everyone.

00:50:07.070 --> 00:50:09.000
One of the things that
Brad Pitt's character

00:50:09.000 --> 00:50:10.750
says in the movie is,

00:50:14.052 --> 00:50:15.613
"You know when you're dying,

00:50:15.613 --> 00:50:17.401
