00:50:29.862 --> 00:50:31.470
Just waiting for my turn to talk, right?

00:50:31.470 --> 00:50:32.303
You just like,

00:50:32.303 --> 00:50:33.458
Oh, I got some.

00:50:33.458 --> 00:50:38.375
And it's one thing for it that
just happened in the context

00:50:39.371 --> 00:50:42.331
